<script setup>
import { Terminal, FolderOpen, Network, ChevronRight, MessageSquare, ShieldCheck, Upload } from 'lucide-vue-next'
defineProps({ server: Object, testing: Boolean })
const emit = defineEmits(['open', 'edit', 'test', 'chat', 'migrate'])
const tools = [{ kind: 'ssh', title: 'SSH 终端', description: '持久连接 · 交互式 Shell', icon: Terminal }, { kind: 'files', title: '文件管理器', description: '浏览 · 预览 · 上传与下载', icon: FolderOpen }, { kind: 'bandwidth', title: '带宽监控', description: '真实网卡速率 · 连续采样', icon: Network }]
</script>
<template><section class="workspace-home"><div class="eyebrow">SERVER / OVERVIEW</div><h1>{{ server.name }}</h1><p><code>{{ server.user || '用户名待补全' }}@{{ server.host }}:{{ server.port }}</code> · {{ server.group || '未分组' }}</p><p v-if="server.configStatus === 'draft'" class="pane-error">待补全：{{ server.missingFields.join('、') }}</p><p v-else>{{ server.lastConnection?.status === 'passed' ? '上次连接测试通过 · ' + new Date(server.lastConnection.checkedAt).toLocaleString('zh-CN') : '连接配置已就绪' }}</p><div class="workspace-actions"><button v-for="tool in tools" :key="tool.kind" :disabled="server.configStatus !== 'configured'" @click="emit('open', tool.kind, server)"><component :is="tool.icon" :size="20" /><span><strong>{{ tool.title }}</strong><small>{{ tool.description }}</small></span><ChevronRight :size="15" /></button></div><div class="home-secondary"><button @click="emit('edit', server)">编辑服务器</button><button :disabled="testing || server.configStatus !== 'configured'" @click="emit('test', server)">{{ testing ? '测试中…' : '测试连接' }}</button><button @click="emit('chat', server)"><MessageSquare :size="15" />新建 Copilot 对话</button><button @click="emit('migrate', server)"><Upload :size="15" />迁移到我的设备</button></div><div class="workspace-note"><ShieldCheck :size="17" /><span>此概览和打开的工具始终绑定 {{ server.name }}。单击左侧服务器打开概览，双击直接进入 SSH。</span></div></section></template>
